---@field copyright? string Identify the copyright holder of the file, as well as any dates present
---@field comment? string This field provides a place for the SPDX file creator to record any general comments about the file
---@field contributors? gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1alpha1.StringList This field provides a place for the SPDX file creator to record file contributors
---@field licenseConcluded? gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1alpha1.License This field contains the license the SPDX file creator has concluded as governing the file or alternative values if the governing license cannot be determined
