---@field message? string A developer-facing error message, which should be in English. Any user-facing error message should be localized and sent in the google.rpc.Status.details field, or localized by the client.
---@field details? gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1alpha1.DocumentMapList A list of messages that carry the error details. There is a common set of message types for APIs to use.

---@alias gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1alpha1.StatusList gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1alpha1.Status[]

